      <h2>Where is OffsetEase based, and where do you deliver?</h2>
      <p>OffsetEase is based in Ahmedabad, India, with senior practitioners working across India, the European Union, Southeast Asia and the Middle East. We work with exporters wherever EU-facing regulation — CBAM, EUDR, ISCC, CSRD — reaches their supply chain.</p>

      <h2>What language do you work in?</h2>
      <p>English. Engagements, documentation and deliverables are in English, which is also the working language of the EU compliance regimes our clients report into.</p>

      <h2>How do remote engagements run?</h2>
      <p>Remote-first and senior-led. The partner who scopes your engagement runs it. Work proceeds in defined stages — scoping, data preparation, delivery and review — with scheduled calls and a shared workspace, so distance does not slow decisions.</p>

      <h2>How quickly do you respond?</h2>
      <p>A senior advisor responds within one business day. Initial consultations are confidential and carry no obligation.</p>

